      "statusChangeNewStatus": "needs more information",
      "value": "Only the getter of `TargetTransform` is exposed to Udon. Additionally, `AddComponent()` is not exposed to Udon, so adding a constraint programatically seems it would be impossible at this time unless you're referring to instantiating a prefab that has a constraint in it.\n\nCan you please provide a code sample demonstrating what you're trying to do? Is this for world development in Udon, or is it in reference to an editor tool written in C#?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
