      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{63c9760ef519ef0b8ce99165|full_name} Sorry but I'm still a little confused, wouldn't an editor tool like this only need to run in edit mode? Entering play mode causes changes to the scene to be lost once you exit play mode.\n\nIf by \"play mode build\" you're referring to making builds of avatars from play mode like how it worked in older SDKs, please note that this approach is now deprecated and no longer officially supported. Users are expected to make avatar builds via the SDK control panel in edit mode instead.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
