  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Constraints latch the \"target transform\" on `Awake` during play mode, even if the constraint is not yet active, this makes it impossible to add a constraint and configure it on the same frame programmatically without first disabling the game object that the constraint is added to (preventing `Awake` from firing) and re-enabling the object after configuring it.",
